  ('chosen-family', 'movie', 'published', 'Chosen Family', 2025, '1h 52m', ARRAY['Drama'], 'United States', 'English', 'Three friends turned family navigate love, loss, and reinvention over one unforgettable summer in Provincetown. When Mia''s engagement falls apart days before the wedding, she flees to the one place that''s always felt like home — only to find her found family scattered, older, and quietly falling apart in their own ways. What starts as a summer of healing becomes a reckoning with who they were, who they''ve become, and whether chosen family can survive the same growing pains as any other kind.', 'Family isn''t always who you''re born with.', 4.8, 'Alex Rivera', NULL, ARRAY['Jordan Lee', 'Sam Park', 'Riley Chen', 'Dana Ruiz'], ARRAY['LGBTQ+', 'Found Family', 'Coming of Age', 'Summer'], DATE '2025-06-20', 112, 'https://picsum.photos/seed/chosen-family/500/750', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/chosen-family-backdrop/1600/900', 'from-brand-pink via-brand-orange to-pride-purple', true, 4800000, now() - interval '336 hours', now() - interval '336 hours'),
