  ('the-proposal-party', 'movie', 'published', 'The Proposal Party', 2025, '1h 29m', ARRAY['Comedy', 'Romance'], 'United States', 'English', 'When two best friends fake an engagement to help one of them qualify for a family inheritance, the plan works a little too well — the fake fiancé''s meddling, over-the-top family throws them an engagement party neither of them is prepared for, and neither is prepared for the very real feelings that start showing up between the lies.', 'Fake it till you feel it.', 4.1, 'Devon Okafor', NULL, ARRAY['Marcus Bell', 'Theo Diaz'], ARRAY['Fake Dating', 'Family', 'LGBTQ+'], DATE '2025-02-01', 89, 'https://picsum.photos/seed/the-proposal-party/500/750', NULL, 'from-brand-orange to-pride-red', false, 0, now() - interval '1536 hours', now() - interval '5 hours'),
